cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Average information across a network quantifies what a coordinative
  structure achieves in motor control. Code and data.
message: If you use this software or these data, please cite the paper.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Code and derived data behind the paper. A verification gate checks the size
  and hash of every released input, recomputes 75 published values behind
  Sections 3.1 to 3.3 and the behavioural check in Section 3.4, and reports
  75 of 75 reproducing. No data were collected for this study;
  every measured value comes from a published table or a released file.
